{"id":"c377646761b0ddc9","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Valuation Map","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map — ZFC Forcing12 Valuation Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map — ZFC Forcing12 Valuation Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map — ZFC Forcing12 Valuation Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,G,\\tau,p\\in V\">\\(P,G,\\tau,p\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> is a class operation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}\\)</span> is the well-founded name-evaluation class operation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ValuationMap}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ValuationMap}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V^2\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ValuationMap}_S(v,P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow G\\subseteq P\n\\land\\exists\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\to v(\\tau)=\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\tau)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ValuationMap}_S(v,P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow G\\subseteq P\n\\land\\exists\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\to v(\\tau)=\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\tau)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing carrier is explicit, and the evaluator is correctly class-typed because the collection of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names is proper-class sized. The defining equation delegates to the registered well-founded evaluation recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-name.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}$ is the well-founded name-evaluation class operation (see [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,G,\\tau,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ValuationMap}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\times V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}valuation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ValuationMap}_S(v,P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow G\\subseteq P\n\\land\\exists\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\to v(\\tau)=\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\tau)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1460,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2059","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map.md|58-df-zfc-forcing12-valuation-map]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","0c40d420e5118724","ec28b62254928d73"]}